  "thag1.42:0.4": "2. Khadiravaniyattheragāthā 42. ",
  "thag1.42:1.1": "‘‘Cāle upacāle sīsūpacāle ( ) ",
  "thag1.42:1.2": "patissatā nu kho viharatha; ",
  "thag1.42:1.3": "Āgato vo vālaṃ viya vedhī’’ti. … ",
  "thag1.42:1.4": "Khadiravaniyo thero…. "
}
